why Every Horde quest of Razorfen Downs in one run.

# Razorfen Downs' Horde quests in one guide: the pick-ups in the Undercity and
# Mulgore, Myriam Moonsinger at the door, one run, then the hand-ins. Steps
# already done are passed over, so the guide picks up wherever the chain
# stands.
#
# The quests: Andrew Brownell's 3341 Bring the End (Amnennar's skull); Sutara
# Plainstalker's 97196 The Coldbringer's Eye; Myriam Moonsinger's 6626 A Host
# of Evil (outside the door); for characters who handed in the first An
# Unholy Alliance (6522, from Razorfen Kraul), Varimathras' 6521 An Unholy
# Alliance (Ambassador Malcin's head, outside the door); inside, Belnistrasz'
# 3523 Scourge of the Downs -> 3525 Extinguishing the Idol.
#
# Left out: 93604 Agamaggan's Blood, the end of the Shen'dralas chain: it
# needs Maraudon's 93404 Rot and Regret and 93601 Passing the Blame first (the
# Maraudon guide holds them).
#
# Inside: nothing in the data places the bosses, Belnistrasz or the Eye
# inside, so their goals stand at the door (@49.0,93.9, The Barrens) with
# `group 5`. The steps follow a run of my own: Tuten'kash, then Belnistrasz and
# his ritual, Plaguemaw the Rotting, Glutton, Amnennar the Coldbringer, with
# the Eye right after him. Every quest goal is counted by the quest log, so a
# group that takes them in another order still gets each step ticked.
#
# Sources (facts only):
# - Quests, NPCs, items, objects and rewards: Polestar's reference data
#   (data/forever, built from QuestieDB Forever 1.1.4) and Polestar 0.4.1.1's
#   Codex page for the dungeon. The Razorfen and the cultists outside are
#   elites of level 33 to 34, Ambassador Malcin one of 36.
# - The door: QuestieDB's list of Forever's dungeons, as Polestar's Codex holds it
#   (data/codex/entrances.json).
# - A run of my own on 2026-11-16 (Horde, five players, level 40), recorded
#   with Polestar's recorder and shared with Polestar Client: the order above,
#   Scourge of the Downs taken and handed in to Belnistrasz after Tuten'kash,
#   Extinguishing the Idol handed in after Plaguemaw, the skull and the Eye
#   after Amnennar.
# - The dungeon's size, levels and bosses: the client's group finder and
#   dungeon journal, as Polestar's Codex page holds them (five players, levels
#   37 to 46).

step Andrew Brownell
  tip In the Undercity.
  accept 3341

step Varimathras
  when turnedin 6522
  accept 6521

step Sutara Plainstalker
  zone Mulgore
  accept 97196

step Myriam Moonsinger
  zone The Barrens
  tip By the dungeon's door.
  accept 6626

step A Host of Evil
  tip The Razorfen and the Death's Head Cultists around the door are elites: bring your group.
  kill 7873 x8 quest 6626.1
  kill 7874 x8 quest 6626.2
  kill 7872 x8 quest 6626.3

step Ambassador Malcin
  when onquest 6521
  tip An elite near the door, with the head Varimathras wants.
  collect 17009 quest 6521.1

step Myriam Moonsinger
  turnin 6626

step To Razorfen Downs
  tip A dungeon for five players of level 37 to 46.
  enter "Razorfen Downs" @49.0,93.9

step Belnistrasz
  tip After Tuten'kash on my run. Talk to him, then protect him while he performs the ritual to shut down the idol; his brazier takes the quest back.
  accept 3523 @49.0,93.9
  turnin 3523 @49.0,93.9
  accept 3525 @49.0,93.9
  complete 3525 @49.0,93.9 group 5

step Belnistrasz's Brazier
  turnin 3525 object 152097 @49.0,93.9

step Amnennar the Coldbringer
  tip The last boss, after Plaguemaw the Rotting and Glutton on my run. He drops his skull, and the Coldbringer's Eye is close by.
  collect 10420 quest 3341.1 @49.0,93.9 group 5
  collect 276916 quest 97196.1 @49.0,93.9 group 5

step Sutara Plainstalker
  zone Mulgore
  turnin 97196

step Andrew Brownell
  zone Undercity
  turnin 3341

step Varimathras
  when onquest 6521
  turnin 6521
